.TH "scalemark-by-suricrasiaonline" "6" "2026-11-17" "scaleMARK User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
scalemark-by-suricrasiaonline - the command to run scaleMARK.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
scalemark-by-suricrasiaonline [\f[I]options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
scaleMARK is a 4k intro released by Suricrasia Online in June 2019,
ranked 1st in the combined intro competition at \[at]party 2019.
.PP
blackle [code, gfx, music]
.PP
By default the intro runs fullscreen at 1920x1080 with 4 samples per
pixel.
Press Escape to quit.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
-w, --window
Run the lighter variant: 640x360 window, 1 sample per pixel.
Use it on slower graphics cards (upstream \f[I]scalemark_small\f[R]).
.TP
-h, --help
Show a short help message and exit.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
.PP
An OpenGL 4.2 capable graphics driver.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=81471
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
